<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Not found &middot; docs.oasis-open.org</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<style>
  :root {
    --oasis-blue: #2248e5;
    --oasis-dark: #0a2540;
    --oasis-cloud: #edf3f9;
    --oasis-yellow: #fae100;
    --oasis-text: #0a2540;
    --oasis-muted: #5a6b80;
    --oasis-border: #d6dee8;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--oasis-cloud);
    color: var(--oasis-text);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  header {
    padding: 22px 32px;
    background: #fff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--oasis-border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  header a.logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  header img.logo-img { height: 36px; width: auto; display: block; }
  header .site-label {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-left: 4px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--oasis-border);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--oasis-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  header .site-label strong {
    color: var(--oasis-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  main {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 56px 24px;
  }
  .card {
    max-width: 580px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .code {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--oasis-blue);
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--oasis-border);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--oasis-dark);
  }
  p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--oasis-muted);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 11px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: box-shadow 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--oasis-blue); color: #fff; }
  .btn-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(34, 72, 229, 0.25); }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--oasis-dark);
    border: 1px solid var(--oasis-border);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--oasis-blue); color: var(--oasis-blue); }
  footer {
    padding: 18px 32px;
    background: #fff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--oasis-border);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--oasis-muted);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  footer a { color: var(--oasis-muted); text-decoration: none; }
  footer a:hover { color: var(--oasis-blue); }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    header { padding: 16px 20px; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    header img.logo-img { height: 30px; }
    header .site-label { padding-left: 14px; font-size: 13px; }
    main, footer { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <a class="logo" href="https://www.oasis-open.org/" aria-label="OASIS Open">
    <img class="logo-img" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="OASIS Open" width="180" height="36">
  </a>
  <span class="site-label"><strong>docs.oasis-open.org</strong></span>
</header>
<main>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="code">404 &middot; Not Found</div>
    <h1>We couldn't find that page.</h1>
    <p>The link may be outdated, or the document may have moved during our recent infrastructure migration. Try browsing from the root of <strong>docs.oasis-open.org</strong>, or head back to the OASIS home page.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">Browse docs</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.oasis-open.org/">OASIS home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>
  <span>&copy; OASIS Open</span>
  <a href="https://www.oasis-open.org/">oasis-open.org</a>
  <a href="https://www.oasis-open.org/contact/">Contact</a>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
